{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>43歲女星陳妍希去年2月宣布與內地男星陳曉離婚，8年婚姻宣告破局。</p><p>近日，她帶家人到泰國度假，並在社群平台分享了一系列的旅遊照，其中一組造型更是讓網友直呼「沈佳宜回來了」。除此之外，整體狀態也意外在網路上引發討論。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165981800569245696092736.jpeg/MF1ZL1VEOF87Z9Q6nTZVM-a6At7iS5lfJ7s5oCe7OaA\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><p>陳妍希遊泰國曬一系列「雙馬尾」制服照</p><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165982022611505152642150.jpeg/CGFyZKqiZoMcewI5ZxUYHbrtpafrwLAUL6N01i-jdNY\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165986843741655040360128.jpeg/IzndJ69Tl8HJrgzfnUYKHWLmnUl-rpGq9UYX3PVGF9w\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165983768633151488831096.jpeg/NVB_1PQ5_nUKl-UPDhfGPUqHWyBWeXkKTgiuYk4IrmI\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165982025497317376581672.jpeg/VITTV3zbqBNc-DkZe5RfHVd70y5N5HeiKL46Vii-OlY\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165982028576067584369215.jpeg/jIPGnbQtFshPWRj0_2D-4KLNJvUAg0MmWcpkhVnKZIU\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165982031491239936103297.jpeg/MuGs6k0q7ARfFNZcGXGL2h06gTXagoyiAGRhQQBkYUE\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165986845968961536849057.jpeg/z6qNsM0jdT3o7trbzwkFNVEKG_Of11fvgr-FpYK_haU\"/><figcaption>陳妍希（微博＠陳妍希michelle）</figcaption></figure><fi